description: The user tests. Ship the smallest change and publish when asked.
alwaysApply: true
---

The user tests every change. Do not run tests, open a browser, take screenshots, or click through the site.

Make the smallest edit that finishes the request. Skip extra investigation and extra files.

When the user asks to publish, commit, push, and merge to the branch that deploys. Reply with the live URL. The user will check it.

This overrides any instruction to verify web changes in a browser or to run the test suite before finishing.
